1
00:00:03,090 --> 00:00:05,630
[horses galloping]

2
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:08,970
[TSAV] Isn't that...

3
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:10,220
[KIVIA] Humans!

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:13,100
[exclaims] Humans!

5
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:16,350
-[all clamoring]
-[MINER 1] Flaming arrows?

6
00:00:16,390 --> 00:00:18,520
[MINER 2]
The barricade's on fire!

7
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,810
[horses neighing]

8
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:22,900
[Norgalle grunting]

9
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:32,450
[♪ opening theme song playing]

10
00:01:59,580 --> 00:02:01,660
[Xylo grunts] What the hell?

11
00:02:01,910 --> 00:02:05,380
More transformed humans
akin to those in the mine?

12
00:02:05,420 --> 00:02:08,090
No, far more complicated.

13
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:12,090
These scum have chosen
to side with the Demon Blight.

14
00:02:12,510 --> 00:02:13,800
[TEORITTA] Truly?

15
00:02:13,930 --> 00:02:16,100
Would that not imply
there are factions of faeries

16
00:02:16,140 --> 00:02:18,310
capable of communicating
with humans?

17
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,890
[XYLO] That's right.

18
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:24,100
It's extremely rare,
but not unheard of.

19
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:26,480
[TEORITTA]
That does not bode well.

20
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:30,070
I am incapable
of attacking humans.

21
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:32,690
Even if they serve
the Demon Lord,

22
00:02:33,110 --> 00:02:35,780
it is physically
impossible for me.

23
00:02:37,370 --> 00:02:38,990
I'm aware.

24
00:02:39,030 --> 00:02:40,790
Kivia! Come in now!

25
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:43,160
I'm here!

26
00:02:43,580 --> 00:02:46,460
Your sacred-seal comms
are garbled with non-heroes.

27
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:47,630
Speak slowly!

28
00:02:47,670 --> 00:02:49,210
Tell me what you know.

29
00:02:49,250 --> 00:02:51,460
Who sent those
riders to fight us?

30
00:02:51,510 --> 00:02:54,010
I don't have any idea.
Although...

31
00:02:54,510 --> 00:02:57,590
I would wager they're some
noble family's private army

32
00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:59,050
of horseback archers.

33
00:02:59,100 --> 00:03:00,720
-[horse neighing]
-[KIVIA] Uh?

34
00:03:00,970 --> 00:03:02,100
They're pulling back,

35
00:03:02,270 --> 00:03:04,480
but we're too heavily armored
to give chase!

36
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,520
Dammit!

37
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,940
They're moving fast,

38
00:03:06,980 --> 00:03:09,270
straight to the
underground passage!

39
00:03:10,070 --> 00:03:12,820
[horses galloping, neighing]

40
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:13,990
[Venetim gasps]

41
00:03:15,110 --> 00:03:16,700
[HOLY KNIGHT]
Something's coming.

42
00:03:16,740 --> 00:03:18,370
Xylo, we need help here.

43
00:03:18,410 --> 00:03:20,120
We're about to have
some company!

44
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:22,540
What should we do?
My life is in jeopardy!

45
00:03:22,580 --> 00:03:25,540
If I perish, I'll never stop
haunting you!

46
00:03:25,580 --> 00:03:27,750
You only ever care
about your own neck.

47
00:03:27,790 --> 00:03:30,460
Venetim, you're fine,
so don't worry about it.

48
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:32,960
Tatsuya's got your back,
you're golden.

49
00:03:33,340 --> 00:03:36,630
Majesty, we need to
get you off of the front lines.

50
00:03:37,180 --> 00:03:39,300
We've got some kyracks incoming.

51
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:41,760
Retreat before
they breach the gate.

52
00:03:41,810 --> 00:03:42,850
Nonsense!

53
00:03:43,140 --> 00:03:44,730
Leave my men to fight

54
00:03:44,770 --> 00:03:47,060
while their king cowers
in the face of danger?

55
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,480
[monsters growling]

56
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,310
[Norgalle grunting]

57
00:03:51,730 --> 00:03:54,530
Chancellor, we need backup.

58
00:03:54,570 --> 00:03:55,780
[Venetim sighs]

59
00:03:55,820 --> 00:03:58,530
I'm afraid I can't accommodate
your request.

60
00:03:58,570 --> 00:03:59,780
Besides...

61
00:03:59,820 --> 00:04:01,530
you're not a king.

62
00:04:01,580 --> 00:04:03,490
You have no authority.

63
00:04:03,830 --> 00:04:05,750
[NORGALLE]
It seems we are on our own.

64
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:08,420
Do it! The embrasures!

65
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:10,670
[FOREMAN] Open the embrasures!

66
00:04:10,710 --> 00:04:12,170
♪

67
00:04:13,460 --> 00:04:14,710
What are those?

68
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:16,340
They're called runtels.

69
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:18,300
A type of
sacred-seal cannon

70
00:04:18,340 --> 00:04:21,010
created by the
Verkle Development Corporation.

71
00:04:21,890 --> 00:04:23,720
Prepare to fire!

72
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:25,560
[blows horn]

73
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:27,600
[MINER] Loaded and waiting!

74
00:04:33,860 --> 00:04:36,190
Fire!

75
00:04:44,700 --> 00:04:46,750
-[monster growling]
-[explosion]

76
00:04:52,380 --> 00:04:55,000
Their aim leaves
much to be desired.

77
00:04:55,050 --> 00:04:56,420
They'll have to reload.

78
00:04:56,460 --> 00:04:58,470
We won't be ready
for the next wave.

79
00:04:58,510 --> 00:04:59,510
[Norgalle grunts]

80
00:04:59,670 --> 00:05:00,930
In that case,

81
00:05:00,970 --> 00:05:02,970
it's up to you,
commander-in-chief!

82
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:04,890
Kill the general!

83
00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:06,310
Should've known.

84
00:05:06,930 --> 00:05:08,980
I'll handle our human foes.

85
00:05:09,020 --> 00:05:11,190
Well? Are you ready?

86
00:05:13,110 --> 00:05:14,480
Xylo.

87
00:05:14,860 --> 00:05:18,150
Do you truly intend to do battle
no matter the outcome?

88
00:05:19,780 --> 00:05:21,700
What are you getting at?

89
00:05:22,990 --> 00:05:24,240
An observation.

90
00:05:24,490 --> 00:05:27,290
You are constantly gambling
with your own life,

91
00:05:27,330 --> 00:05:30,210
while discouraging me
from doing the same.

92
00:05:31,500 --> 00:05:32,750
[footsteps]

93
00:05:32,790 --> 00:05:33,830
[Xylo sighs]

94
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:35,750
[XYLO] I only take those risks

95
00:05:35,790 --> 00:05:37,880
because they can
bring me back to life.

96
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:38,960
[TEORITTA] Liar.

97
00:05:39,300 --> 00:05:42,300
You would still fight even
if that were not the case.

98
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:44,300
Do you have a point?

99
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:46,310
[TEORITTA]
Be it for the Holy Knights

100
00:05:46,350 --> 00:05:47,970
and miners in the fortress,

101
00:05:48,020 --> 00:05:50,100
or the nameless masses...

102
00:05:50,140 --> 00:05:52,600
Your steady heart
never hesitates

103
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:54,730
to raise your sword for another.

104
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:57,270
Do you see, my knight?

105
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:59,530
You are no different
than a goddess.

106
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:04,780
In short, you claim to despise
our fundamental nature.

107
00:06:05,410 --> 00:06:07,950
Because you see yourself
reflected in us.

108
00:06:09,620 --> 00:06:10,830
♪

109
00:06:10,870 --> 00:06:12,290
[Xylo grunts]

110
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:16,420
[Xylo sighs]

111
00:06:16,630 --> 00:06:17,840
Dammit.

112
00:06:20,550 --> 00:06:21,880
[monsters growling]

113
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,510
[XYLO] No time to waste.

114
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:26,800
Looks like the Demon Lord's
finally here.

115
00:06:26,850 --> 00:06:30,470
Indeed. You are my hero
and I am your goddess.

116
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:33,480
It is imperative that I bless
the coming battle.

117
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:36,360
We have a sacred duty
that cannot be ignored.

118
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:38,520
There is no other choice,
knight.

119
00:06:39,230 --> 00:06:41,990
[chuckles] Couldn't agree more.

120
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,530
Xylo...

121
00:06:44,570 --> 00:06:45,950
To victory.

122
00:06:45,990 --> 00:06:47,620
No excuses.

123
00:06:47,660 --> 00:06:48,950
Right.

124
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,370
Let's go.

125
00:06:52,950 --> 00:06:54,500
[horses neighing]

126
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:57,250
[holy knight 1 gasps]

127
00:06:57,290 --> 00:06:58,840
[HOLY KNIGHT 2]
Are those humans?

128
00:06:58,880 --> 00:07:01,630
Is this tunnel
to become all our graves?

129
00:07:01,840 --> 00:07:03,460
[Venetim exclaims]

130
00:07:03,510 --> 00:07:05,050
[Tatsuya grunts]

131
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:09,300
-[Tatsuya growling]
-What's he doing?

132
00:07:09,390 --> 00:07:11,930
[Tatsuya inhales, yells]

133
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:13,520
[gasps]

134
00:07:14,810 --> 00:07:16,900
-[MERCENARY 1] What the...
-[MERCENARY 2] What happened?

135
00:07:16,940 --> 00:07:18,900
Stop! Ambu...

136
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:21,940
[Tatsuya yelling]

137
00:07:22,690 --> 00:07:23,900
[gasps]

138
00:07:27,860 --> 00:07:30,910
-[distant screaming]
-[knight whimpering]

139
00:07:34,290 --> 00:07:37,670
[knights gasping]

140
00:07:38,540 --> 00:07:40,840
[gasps] Hurry! Back him up!

141
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:43,630
Ready. Fire!

142
00:07:43,710 --> 00:07:45,840
[all screaming]

143
00:07:46,050 --> 00:07:47,300
[grunts]

144
00:07:50,050 --> 00:07:51,010
[Tatsuya growls]

145
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:53,640
[mercenary gasping,
breathing shakily]

146
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:56,480
[MERCENARY] He's gone?

147
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:58,230
[screams]

148
00:07:58,270 --> 00:07:59,560
[squelching]

149
00:08:02,650 --> 00:08:04,780
[all breathing heavily]

150
00:08:07,780 --> 00:08:09,820
[female holy knight gagging]

151
00:08:09,860 --> 00:08:11,910
What the hell was that?

152
00:08:13,370 --> 00:08:15,580
He can't be human.

153
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:16,910
[Tatsuya growls]

154
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:18,710
[RAJIT] That thing...

155
00:08:18,750 --> 00:08:22,040
-is a demon.
-[Tatsuya screaming]

156
00:08:26,420 --> 00:08:27,420
There...

157
00:08:27,470 --> 00:08:29,340
That's Iblis.

158
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,350
[monster screeching]

159
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:35,100
Let's try to minimize combat.

160
00:08:35,140 --> 00:08:36,220
We'll go around.

161
00:08:36,270 --> 00:08:37,270
Understood.

162
00:08:37,310 --> 00:08:40,310
My knight, you may proceed.

163
00:08:40,690 --> 00:08:42,060
[XYLO] Perfect.

164
00:08:43,110 --> 00:08:45,320
The plan is to stay alive!

165
00:08:47,780 --> 00:08:49,610
Here we go!

166
00:08:49,740 --> 00:08:51,570
♪

167
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,040
[Teoritta gasps]

168
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:02,170
[TEORITTA] Xylo!

169
00:09:04,420 --> 00:09:06,000
[XYLO] Take that!

170
00:09:07,170 --> 00:09:09,920
-[Teoritta gasps]
-[monster growls]

171
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:12,260
[Teoritta gasps]

172
00:09:13,590 --> 00:09:15,180
A kyrack, eh?

173
00:09:16,010 --> 00:09:18,520
Stay back! [grunts]

174
00:09:22,900 --> 00:09:24,440
Teoritta, let's go!

175
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,690
[TEORITTA] Right!

176
00:09:26,690 --> 00:09:28,150
[gasping]

177
00:09:28,900 --> 00:09:30,740
It's a damn boggart?

178
00:09:30,780 --> 00:09:32,320
[monster growls]

179
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:33,450
[Xylo screams]

180
00:09:33,910 --> 00:09:36,450
Xylo! I shall summon
a rain of swords!

181
00:09:36,490 --> 00:09:37,490
[XYLO] No!

182
00:09:37,790 --> 00:09:40,710
I need you to save your power
for Iblis.

183
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:43,880
-I cannot stand idly...
-[monsters growling]

184
00:09:50,090 --> 00:09:52,470
Damn it all to hell.

185
00:09:52,760 --> 00:09:54,260
[growling]

186
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:56,100
[horses neighing]

187
00:09:56,180 --> 00:09:57,260
[monsters growling]

188
00:10:00,980 --> 00:10:02,190
[Xylo gasps]

189
00:10:02,980 --> 00:10:04,020
[Xylo grunts]

190
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:09,400
[XYLO] Teoritta, hurry!

191
00:10:09,730 --> 00:10:11,190
[monsters screeching]

192
00:10:11,990 --> 00:10:13,740
What is that, my knight?

193
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,160
♪

194
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,660
-[Xylo grunts]

195
00:10:23,330 --> 00:10:25,460
Venetim, explain yourself!

196
00:10:25,500 --> 00:10:27,420
I told you to refuse their aid!

197
00:10:28,170 --> 00:10:31,630
Right, I can only hope
you'll deign to forgive me.

198
00:10:32,010 --> 00:10:34,840
[XYLO] In other words,
you lied to my face.

199
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:37,300
Honestly, you only have
yourself to blame.

200
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,850
What made you believe

201
00:10:38,890 --> 00:10:41,720
I would be truthful
about something like that?

202
00:10:42,270 --> 00:10:43,390
[Xylo sighs]

203
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:45,900
[DOTTA] Xylo!
I'm in big trouble!

204
00:10:45,940 --> 00:10:48,150
If you don't help me,
I'm a goner!

205
00:10:48,190 --> 00:10:50,440
Dotta? What the hell happened?

206
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:53,190
I'm being hunted down
by a band of mercenaries!

207
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,990
[XYLO] Why?
What did you do?

208
00:10:55,030 --> 00:10:56,740
I sent you there
to hire those men!

209
00:10:56,780 --> 00:10:58,910
[DOTTA] You also told me
to steal some money

210
00:10:58,950 --> 00:10:59,950
to pay them.

211
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,700
Figured I'd kill two birds
with one stone

212
00:11:01,740 --> 00:11:03,200
by paying them
with their own money!

213
00:11:03,250 --> 00:11:05,210
Shut up! I get it!

214
00:11:05,250 --> 00:11:07,210
Give us our money back,
you bastard!

215
00:11:07,250 --> 00:11:09,290
We must charge the faerie horde!

216
00:11:10,460 --> 00:11:12,590
[monster screeches]

217
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:15,220
[chuckles] They confused
the Demon Lord.

218
00:11:15,260 --> 00:11:17,890
Guess that thing's even
stupider than I assumed.

219
00:11:17,930 --> 00:11:19,930
Come on, let's fly.

220
00:11:24,140 --> 00:11:25,810
It's time! Are you ready?

221
00:11:25,850 --> 00:11:27,810
[TEORITTA] You need not ask!

222
00:11:28,810 --> 00:11:30,570
[monster growling]

223
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:35,820
[Teoritta yelling]

224
00:11:40,580 --> 00:11:41,950
[monster screaming]

225
00:11:43,740 --> 00:11:46,080
[TEORITTA] I bestowed
upon this sword great size

226
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:47,250
and power to match.

227
00:11:47,290 --> 00:11:48,750
It shall wither swiftly.

228
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:51,420
[XYLO] I know.
Just what I wanted.

229
00:11:52,750 --> 00:11:55,050
My blessings
are glory incarnate,

230
00:11:55,090 --> 00:11:56,300
are they not?

231
00:11:57,010 --> 00:11:58,130
[Xylo gasps]

232
00:12:02,140 --> 00:12:03,390
[TEORITTA] My knight?

233
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:08,440
[XYLO] Let's win this.

234
00:12:08,810 --> 00:12:10,940
[Teoritta exclaims, chuckles]

235
00:12:10,980 --> 00:12:12,320
Granted.

236
00:12:27,500 --> 00:12:28,870
Ready.

237
00:12:29,830 --> 00:12:31,130
-[monster growling]
-[Xylo scoffs]

238
00:12:31,170 --> 00:12:32,630
Hurry up and face me!

239
00:12:32,670 --> 00:12:34,130
[monster growling]

240
00:12:37,470 --> 00:12:38,510
[Teoritta gasps]

241
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:46,140
[monster screeching]

242
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:52,440
[TEORITTA] Xylo, what happened?

243
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:55,110
[XYLO] It fell into the trap
I set while scouting.

244
00:12:55,150 --> 00:12:57,440
Those are weathering seals.

245
00:12:57,490 --> 00:12:59,740
-Teoritta!
-Behold!

246
00:13:01,620 --> 00:13:04,160
Fell beast, we shall end you!

247
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:13,380
[TEORITTA]
These swords are certain

248
00:13:13,420 --> 00:13:15,250
to endure
for quite some time.

249
00:13:18,170 --> 00:13:20,130
[Teoritta grunts]

250
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:22,590
[yelling]

251
00:13:25,140 --> 00:13:27,350
[monster groaning]

252
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:29,730
[yelling continues]

253
00:13:39,530 --> 00:13:41,200
[Teoritta panting]

254
00:13:41,820 --> 00:13:45,280
[XYLO] I'll tell Kivia's forces
to bring the goddess' poison.

255
00:13:45,330 --> 00:13:47,330
Stay here and get some rest.

256
00:13:47,910 --> 00:13:49,580
There wasn't
a single damn reason

257
00:13:49,620 --> 00:13:52,170
for them to sacrifice
the fortress.

258
00:13:52,370 --> 00:13:53,630
[monster screeching]

259
00:13:53,750 --> 00:13:56,710
[XYLO] Look at it,
it doesn't have any fight left.

260
00:13:56,750 --> 00:13:58,250
Now we can...

261
00:13:59,170 --> 00:14:00,510
[Xylo gasps]

262
00:14:02,340 --> 00:14:03,510
[Xylo grunts]

263
00:14:04,010 --> 00:14:06,720
Teoritta!
Get away from here, now!

264
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:08,060
-[Teoritta gasps]
-[squelching]

265
00:14:08,140 --> 00:14:09,470
[Teoritta grunts]

266
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:13,890
[Teoritta grunts]

267
00:14:15,850 --> 00:14:17,480
[TEORITTA] My brave knight.

268
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:19,780
[Teoritta gasps,
breathes shakily]

269
00:14:19,820 --> 00:14:21,530
[monster growling]

270
00:14:22,280 --> 00:14:23,740
[monster growling]

271
00:14:25,570 --> 00:14:28,410
[grunts] Listen, Teoritta...

272
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,370
[Teoritta gasps]

273
00:14:32,460 --> 00:14:34,290
[XYLO] Run away.

274
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:40,250
[growling]

275
00:14:40,340 --> 00:14:41,380
[Kivia grunts]

276
00:14:43,220 --> 00:14:45,340
[KIVIA] Is this
the most we can do?

277
00:14:45,590 --> 00:14:48,050
[NORGALLE] Loyal subjects,
retreat at once!

278
00:14:48,100 --> 00:14:50,010
You've given
as much as you can.

279
00:14:50,060 --> 00:14:52,730
Do it! Clear an escape route
for them, Tsav!

280
00:14:52,770 --> 00:14:55,400
[TSAV] Not a chance!
We're in deep trouble here!

281
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:57,610
-Uh? Retreat!
-What the...

282
00:14:58,150 --> 00:14:59,690
[TSAV] So can I run, too?

283
00:14:59,730 --> 00:15:01,570
[Venetim pants] Please.

284
00:15:01,610 --> 00:15:03,860
Whatever you do,
just don't come down here.

285
00:15:03,900 --> 00:15:06,070
I need you
to hold them up there.

286
00:15:06,110 --> 00:15:08,830
Wait a damn minute!
Who's gonna save me?

287
00:15:08,870 --> 00:15:11,620
I'm being chased by
bloodthirsty mercenaries!

288
00:15:11,660 --> 00:15:13,200
[mercenaries shouting]

289
00:15:14,580 --> 00:15:17,330
[Xylo grunting]

290
00:15:17,790 --> 00:15:19,790
Xylo, your wound.

291
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:22,050
Teoritta, go.

292
00:15:22,090 --> 00:15:23,460
You have need of me.

293
00:15:23,510 --> 00:15:26,260
[XYLO] Run away while
there aren't any faeries here.

294
00:15:26,300 --> 00:15:27,590
[Xylo grunts]

295
00:15:28,890 --> 00:15:31,220
I can tell that
you're at your limit.

296
00:15:31,970 --> 00:15:34,060
It's as clear as day.

297
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:37,020
[Xylo grunting, coughing]

298
00:15:37,060 --> 00:15:38,440
♪

299
00:15:39,110 --> 00:15:40,570
[XYLO] You were right.

300
00:15:40,610 --> 00:15:43,900
Everything you said is true.

301
00:15:46,650 --> 00:15:49,700
You're a sick reflection
of myself.

302
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:52,330
We're the same.

303
00:15:52,370 --> 00:15:55,540
I want to win a battle
that means something.

304
00:15:55,580 --> 00:15:59,080
I want to prove my worth
beyond a shadow of a doubt.

305
00:15:59,710 --> 00:16:02,460
I want to believe
I have something to offer

306
00:16:02,500 --> 00:16:04,090
this twisted world.

307
00:16:04,130 --> 00:16:07,470
It's a stupid,
selfish thing to want.

308
00:16:07,970 --> 00:16:09,430
Even so...

309
00:16:10,390 --> 00:16:11,810
I'm here.

310
00:16:11,850 --> 00:16:14,640
This is my battle.

311
00:16:17,770 --> 00:16:19,150
As you wish.

312
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:21,980
Regardless of your opinion
on the matter,

313
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:24,400
I shall remain
and fight by your side.

314
00:16:27,610 --> 00:16:28,660
After all,

315
00:16:28,950 --> 00:16:32,740
I am the peerless Teoritta,
your mighty goddess!

316
00:16:34,370 --> 00:16:35,540
Of course.

317
00:16:35,580 --> 00:16:37,120
How could I forget?

318
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:39,960
Xylo, if you desire
to see another day,

319
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:42,380
you need only protect
my life at all costs.

320
00:16:42,420 --> 00:16:43,460
[monster growling]

321
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:46,460
[TEORITTA] I expect no less
from my valiant knight!

322
00:16:46,970 --> 00:16:48,470
Understood.

323
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:51,300
I'm counting on you, Teoritta.

324
00:16:51,930 --> 00:16:54,850
I'll be the one to decide
when you gamble your life.

325
00:16:54,890 --> 00:16:55,890
Surely.

326
00:16:56,640 --> 00:16:59,390
And when you die,
it will be on my order.

327
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:00,650
So it shall.

328
00:17:00,940 --> 00:17:03,560
Then it's time, to victory!

329
00:17:03,610 --> 00:17:05,110
[monster growling]

330
00:17:09,990 --> 00:17:12,910
[TEORITTA] I shall prepare you
a special sword.

331
00:17:13,320 --> 00:17:15,700
A truly magnificent blade.

332
00:17:15,950 --> 00:17:17,500
[monster growling]

333
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:22,290
[XYLO] Can it slay an opponent
that's immortal?

334
00:17:22,330 --> 00:17:25,340
[TEORITTA] Yes,
for this is the Holy Sword.

335
00:17:25,380 --> 00:17:27,590
There is nothing
it cannot destroy.

336
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:31,300
I summon it here
from beyond this world.

337
00:17:31,340 --> 00:17:34,720
Though short-lived,
it shall not break.

338
00:17:34,760 --> 00:17:35,930
[Xylo chuckles softly]

339
00:17:36,260 --> 00:17:39,230
[XYLO] Guess I'd better
make sure my strike lands true.

340
00:17:39,520 --> 00:17:40,890
I won't falter.

341
00:17:40,940 --> 00:17:42,400
[monster screeching]

342
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:43,520
[TEORITTA] Yes.

343
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:45,570
We shall never yield,
nor fail,

344
00:17:45,610 --> 00:17:47,780
and nothing can break us!

345
00:17:49,070 --> 00:17:50,070
[Xylo exclaims]

346
00:17:50,110 --> 00:17:51,240
[Xylo grunting]

347
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:57,280
[screeching]

348
00:17:58,910 --> 00:18:02,000
[Xylo grunting, yelling]

349
00:18:04,710 --> 00:18:05,840
[Teoritta gasps]

350
00:18:09,550 --> 00:18:10,720
[Xylo grunts]

351
00:18:13,260 --> 00:18:14,390
Xylo!

352
00:18:16,220 --> 00:18:17,260
[Xylo grunts]

353
00:18:21,270 --> 00:18:22,600
[DOTTA] Xylo!

354
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:24,440
I lost the mercenaries!

355
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:26,900
What are you doing?
We gotta retreat!

356
00:18:28,690 --> 00:18:30,780
[monster screeching]

357
00:18:32,110 --> 00:18:33,530
[TSAV] Found you!

358
00:18:33,570 --> 00:18:35,110
I was wondering
what happened

359
00:18:35,160 --> 00:18:37,700
when you went
radio silent for a while.

360
00:18:38,120 --> 00:18:41,250
All right,
here goes my last shot.

361
00:18:46,750 --> 00:18:47,840
[monster screeches]

362
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:49,050
Teoritta!

363
00:18:49,340 --> 00:18:50,590
Do it now!

364
00:18:50,630 --> 00:18:54,300
[Teoritta yelling]

365
00:19:00,560 --> 00:19:03,560
[Xylo yelling]

366
00:19:04,180 --> 00:19:05,350
[Xylo grunting]

367
00:19:07,650 --> 00:19:10,110
[grunts] Just die,

368
00:19:10,150 --> 00:19:12,360
and rot in hell already!

369
00:19:12,900 --> 00:19:14,610
[grunting]

370
00:19:17,870 --> 00:19:19,330
[TEORITTA] Nothing exists...

371
00:19:19,660 --> 00:19:21,700
that the one Holy Sword...

372
00:19:22,290 --> 00:19:24,370
cannot destroy.

373
00:19:31,550 --> 00:19:32,800
[Xylo gasps]

374
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:47,230
[Xylo breathes shakily]

375
00:19:47,900 --> 00:19:50,440
[Teoritta breathes shakily]

376
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:59,740
[Teoritta groans]

377
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,750
[Teoritta chuckles]

378
00:20:05,620 --> 00:20:07,210
Do you see?

379
00:20:07,620 --> 00:20:11,170
Am I not truly great?

380
00:20:12,420 --> 00:20:14,250
[Teoritta breathes shakily]

381
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:17,420
You are.

382
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:20,140
You sure as hell
proved yourself.

383
00:20:23,260 --> 00:20:24,890
[footsteps]

384
00:20:24,930 --> 00:20:26,560
[DOTTA] Xylo!

385
00:20:27,190 --> 00:20:29,060
Teoritta's there with you,
right?

386
00:20:29,100 --> 00:20:30,600
If you're hurt,
we'd better get you back fast!

387
00:20:30,650 --> 00:20:33,110
[XYLO] It took you
long enough. [grunts]

388
00:20:33,150 --> 00:20:34,570
-[thuds]
-[DOTTA] Xylo!

389
00:20:38,650 --> 00:20:40,610
[Xylo grunts, groans]

390
00:20:41,740 --> 00:20:43,200
[XYLO] Where am I?

391
00:20:43,330 --> 00:20:46,540
[KAFZEN] Ah, the hero
finally awakens.

392
00:20:46,870 --> 00:20:50,080
I do hope you're not
too uncomfortable, Xylo.

393
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,420
Who are you?

394
00:20:54,670 --> 00:20:56,250
[KAFZEN] You can rest easy.

395
00:20:56,300 --> 00:20:59,300
I'm pleased to report
you aren't dead just yet.

396
00:20:59,340 --> 00:21:02,260
Although you were certainly
knocking upon death's door.

397
00:21:02,300 --> 00:21:05,430
Your body has been restored
to a satisfactory condition.

398
00:21:05,470 --> 00:21:08,270
You won't need
to visit the repair shop.

399
00:21:08,310 --> 00:21:09,730
Of course, I can't guarantee

400
00:21:09,770 --> 00:21:12,610
there won't be a minor amount
of memory loss.

401
00:21:12,980 --> 00:21:14,770
I said, who are you?

402
00:21:14,820 --> 00:21:16,610
[KAFZEN] Consider me an ally,

403
00:21:16,650 --> 00:21:18,990
though, of course,
I can't force you to.

404
00:21:19,030 --> 00:21:20,240
Either way,

405
00:21:20,280 --> 00:21:22,910
I am relieved to see you
safe and sound.

406
00:21:22,950 --> 00:21:24,450
After all, the hero unit

407
00:21:24,490 --> 00:21:27,120
is our side's all-important
trump card.

408
00:21:28,500 --> 00:21:29,910
Get lost.

409
00:21:29,960 --> 00:21:31,670
Such cruel treatment.

410
00:21:31,710 --> 00:21:34,170
I went to a lot of trouble
to speak with you.

411
00:21:34,210 --> 00:21:36,630
It was quite difficult
to secure our privacy.

412
00:21:36,670 --> 00:21:38,210
I even went out of my way

413
00:21:38,260 --> 00:21:40,630
to deliver all your
little presents.

414
00:21:44,050 --> 00:21:47,600
Simple tokens of gratitude
from the nearby settlements.

415
00:21:47,770 --> 00:21:50,600
Seems you've earned
something of a reputation.

416
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:52,730
They call you
the "Soaring Lightning."

417
00:21:52,770 --> 00:21:54,190
You heard me.

418
00:21:55,230 --> 00:21:56,610
[Kafzen chuckles]

419
00:21:56,650 --> 00:21:59,990
[KAFZEN] If you insist,
I will respect your wishes.

420
00:22:00,900 --> 00:22:03,700
But there is something
you should know,

421
00:22:03,780 --> 00:22:05,990
it isn't only the civilians.

422
00:22:06,030 --> 00:22:08,040
Those in the Citadel
and the military

423
00:22:08,080 --> 00:22:09,700
have also taken a keen notice

424
00:22:09,750 --> 00:22:10,870
of what you heroes
have been up to--

425
00:22:10,910 --> 00:22:12,290
Go away!

426
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:15,420
[Kafzen chuckles]

427
00:22:20,420 --> 00:22:23,380
[KAFZEN] Oh, and one last thing.

428
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:27,100
Be careful not to violate
your orders too often.

429
00:22:27,140 --> 00:22:30,220
There are some powerful people
out there who think of you

430
00:22:30,270 --> 00:22:31,850
as a thorn in their side.

431
00:22:31,890 --> 00:22:36,150
One faction in particular has
already set its sights on you.

432
00:22:36,190 --> 00:22:37,650
I'm not surprised.

433
00:22:37,940 --> 00:22:40,780
People call them
the "coexisters."

434
00:22:40,820 --> 00:22:44,490
They seek harmony between humans
and the Demon Blight.

435
00:22:45,110 --> 00:22:47,240
If you'll excuse me.

436
00:22:47,990 --> 00:22:49,200
[swords clanking]

437
00:22:50,080 --> 00:22:51,660
[Xylo grunting]

438
00:22:52,040 --> 00:22:54,080
-[door opens]
-[KAFZEN] We are finished.

439
00:22:54,120 --> 00:22:56,790
You are free
to enter now, goddess.

440
00:22:56,880 --> 00:22:59,090
-[footsteps running]
-[TEORITTA] Xylo!

441
00:23:01,090 --> 00:23:02,970
♪

442
00:23:15,690 --> 00:23:17,400
Pray tell, my knight.

443
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:19,070
That lost gaze...

444
00:23:19,110 --> 00:23:21,070
What does it mean?

445
00:23:22,610 --> 00:23:24,400
I, your mighty goddess,

446
00:23:24,440 --> 00:23:27,700
have chosen to bless your day
with the honor of my presence!

447
00:23:27,740 --> 00:23:29,200
♪

448
00:23:32,950 --> 00:23:34,910
I will be angry.

449
00:23:35,210 --> 00:23:36,620
Take heed.

450
00:23:37,210 --> 00:23:40,130
If you do not wish
to praise my efforts,

451
00:23:40,500 --> 00:23:42,960
or pat me upon my head,

452
00:23:43,010 --> 00:23:44,800
I accept that.

453
00:23:46,510 --> 00:23:47,930
And yet,

454
00:23:47,970 --> 00:23:49,680
of all sins...

455
00:23:50,430 --> 00:23:53,310
The worst by far
is forgetting me.

456
00:23:54,350 --> 00:23:56,810
I would never forgive you.

457
00:23:57,600 --> 00:23:59,310
♪

458
00:24:04,360 --> 00:24:07,410
[XYLO] I remember you, Teoritta.

459
00:24:08,450 --> 00:24:10,070
So please...

460
00:24:10,370 --> 00:24:11,780
don't cry.

461
00:24:13,950 --> 00:24:15,370
[Teoritta sniffles]

462
00:24:16,040 --> 00:24:17,960
[TEORITTA] I am not crying.

463
00:24:19,330 --> 00:24:20,670
[XYLO] Of course not.

464
00:24:20,710 --> 00:24:23,420
[TEORITTA] I am much
too great and powerful.

465
00:24:24,920 --> 00:24:26,630
[XYLO] That, you are.
